      "widgets_values": [
        "Base W8 · original BF16 TE · 50 steps\n1024 × 1024 · fixed seed 314159265 · 50 steps · CFG 3 · Euler / sgm_uniform · shift 5 · SLG layer 22.\nAttention auto; VAE BF16 is an explicit precision tradeoff; TE memory auto. Manifest-listed download bytes: 22,468,789,822.\nLegacy INT8 ConvRot TE is W8A16. All conditioning outputs remain FP16. Public checkpoints are not claimed byte-identical to private R4 benchmark weights.\nOpening does not download models. Download all listed files first; for original HF TE keep text_encoder/ and sibling tokenizer/ directory structure. Controls stay idle; use the buttons for prewarm/unload.\nORIGINAL BF16: all four original shards + index/config + tokenizer required. te_checkpoint=auto resolves models/text_encoders/MOSS-Image-Base/text_encoder. This is dense original BF16 compute, with FP16 output conditioning. Other variants use FP16 compute."
